window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Reaper:</b></p> <p>I’m a violent man. A killer. Life means little to me. She wasn’t my first, and she certainly wouldn’t be my last. And then she got away and knocked me off kilter. No one has ever escaped before her. I’ll watch her until she thinks she’s safe. And then I’ll give her the choice. Be mine or die.</p> <p><b>Arabella:</b></p> <p>Following a near death experience, I vow to live life to the fullest. Escaping from a serial killer gives you a new lease on life. I’m not willing to live in fear. Then he finds me and this time I know there will be no escape.</p> <p><b><i>Will Arabella drag a homicidal maniac into the light, or will he pull her into the dark?</i></b></p>"; 
